' Library Management Application — Business Workflow Diagram
' Auto-split from library-management-business-workflow.puml
' Render this file individually to avoid HTTP header size limits

@startuml Notification_Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam titleFontSize 16

title Notification Workflow — Email & Teams\n(FR-011, FR-012, FR-013)

|Recommendation Engine|
start
:Recommendation content ready\nfor all monitored libraries;

|Notification Service|
:Receive recommendation content;

fork
  |Email Channel (FR-011)|
  :Format content for email;
  :Build email message:\n----\n**Subject:** Library Version Update Report\n**Body:**\n• Library comparison summary\n• New version alerts\n• Upgrade recommendations\n• Pros and cons\n• Release notes excerpt\n----;
  :Send to configured\nemail recipients;
  if (Delivery OK?) then (yes)
    :Log: Email Sent;
    :Record Email Notification entity;
  else (no)
    :Log: Email Failed;
    :Queue for retry;
  endif

fork again
  |Teams Channel (FR-012)|
  :Format content for Teams;
  :Build Teams group message:\n----\n📚 Library Management Update\n• Version comparison results\n• Upgrade guidance\n• Pros/Cons summary\n----;
  :Post to configured\nTeams group;
  if (Post OK?) then (yes)
    :Log: Teams Posted;
    :Record Teams Notification entity;
  else (no)
    :Log: Teams Failed;
    :Queue for retry;
  endif

end fork

|Schedule Manager (FR-013)|
:Update Last Run Date;
:Calculate Next Run Date;
:Wait for next regular schedule;

stop

note bottom
  Both Email and Teams notifications
  are sent **regularly** based on
  the generated recommendation content
end note

@enduml
